(6718775, 1005453, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting wide angle shot.  I think it could be made much better if you cropped out the mouth entirely, then cropped out some of the wall behind the left eye.  Then, in post, you could really pull out the blacks.  This image suffers because it''s a bit bland.  Needs some dark darks for some added drama.</td>', 'Interesting wide angle shot.  I think it could be made much better if you cropped out the mouth entirely, then cropped out some of the wall behind the left eye.  Then, in post, you could really pull out the blacks.  This image suffers because it''s a bit bland.  Needs some dark darks for some added drama.', '2012-03-21 11:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6718778, 1004964, 142473, '<td valign="top">Not a bad portrait, but the even lighting isn''t great for making the subject really interesting.</td>', 'Not a bad portrait, but the even lighting isn''t great for making the subject really interesting.', '2012-03-21 11:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6718781, 1005276, 142473, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting macro-esque image.  The water adds a lot to the image, as far as interest.  To me, the nose gripper is really distracting.  If that could have been out of frame, I think it would have been a big improvement.</td>', 'It''s an interesting macro-esque image.  The water adds a lot to the image, as far as interest.  To me, the nose gripper is really distracting.  If that could have been out of frame, I think it would have been a big improvement.', '2012-03-21 11:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
