(6718786, 1005489, 142473, '<td valign="top">Good focus, cute dog.  I wish the left eye was a little more visible though.</td>', 'Good focus, cute dog.  I wish the left eye was a little more visible though.', '2012-03-21 12:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6718791, 1005319, 142473, '<td valign="top">Really interesting coloring.  My only qualm is that the subject is smack dab in the center.  Crop off the bottom 1/3 of the image and you''ve already got an improvement.  Then crop off the left 1/3, and you''re even better... in my opinion of course.</td>', 'Really interesting coloring.  My only qualm is that the subject is smack dab in the center.  Crop off the bottom 1/3 of the image and you''ve already got an improvement.  Then crop off the left 1/3, and you''re even better... in my opinion of course.', '2012-03-21 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
