(6718917, 1005278, 118154, '<td valign="top">She has a memorable face.</td>', 'She has a memorable face.', '2012-03-21 14:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6718939, 1005207, 141319, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what those 2 stripes in the background are, but I find them distracting. Other than that a really nice image. Like the composition, the colours, the whole idea.</td>', 'Don''t know what those 2 stripes in the background are, but I find them distracting. Other than that a really nice image. Like the composition, the colours, the whole idea.', '2012-03-21 14:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6718944, 1005372, 141319, '<td valign="top">Although the glasses don''t necessarily have to be the main focus IMO, I do think that they have to add in a significant way to the image to fulfill the challenge. I don''t think the glasses here do that job. I also find the lighting very distracting with the brigh window. My eye keeps jumping between the window and the guitar. Maybe a totally different crop would have helped the viewer more to focus?</td>', 'Although the glasses don''t necessarily have to be the main focus IMO, I do think that they have to add in a significant way to the image to fulfill the challenge. I don''t think the glasses here do that job. I also find the lighting very distracting with the brigh window. My eye keeps jumping between the window and the guitar. Maybe a totally different crop would have helped the viewer more to focus?', '2012-03-21 14:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6718949, 1005433, 141319, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of model. Very much like your background and angle, really ads fun to the picture. The glasses are definitely focus of attention, despite the cute kid :-). I don''t like the rfelection in the glasses so much though, especially the light at the top rim really distracts</td>', 'I like your choice of model. Very much like your background and angle, really ads fun to the picture. The glasses are definitely focus of attention, despite the cute kid :-). I don''t like the rfelection in the glasses so much though, especially the light at the top rim really distracts', '2012-03-21 14:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6718990, 1005431, 141319, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph. Only thing are the little light dots both on the glasses as well as on the face. Perhaps they should have been edited out. Love the see-through effect of the head and the dark hat in contrast</td>', 'I like this photograph. Only thing are the little light dots both on the glasses as well as on the face. Perhaps they should have been edited out. Love the see-through effect of the head and the dark hat in contrast', '2012-03-21 15:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6718991, 1005417, 141319, '<td valign="top">Great idea - love the Out of focus for this. Just can''t get "what" it is that is in the glasses - would perhaps have been a better image with something more obvious ?</td>', 'Great idea - love the Out of focus for this. Just can''t get "what" it is that is in the glasses - would perhaps have been a better image with something more obvious ?', '2012-03-21 15:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
