(6719910, 1005106, 142473, '<td valign="top">To be honest, from the thumbnail I wasn''t too keen on this image.  But Once I opened it I really loved it.  Something about the good leading lines and clarity.</td>', 'To be honest, from the thumbnail I wasn''t too keen on this image.  But Once I opened it I really loved it.  Something about the good leading lines and clarity.', '2012-03-22 10:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
