(6721306, 1004997, 134859, '<td valign="top">Cute.  The glasses are a little tilted, but it''s a good shot.  My dog would have NEVER allowed this.  He would have been chewing on them before I could pick the camera up.  Well done.</td>', 'Cute.  The glasses are a little tilted, but it''s a good shot.  My dog would have NEVER allowed this.  He would have been chewing on them before I could pick the camera up.  Well done.', '2012-03-23 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6721356, 1005018, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the uniqueness of this shot.  The cactus is not something you would usually think of to put glasses on.  The title is great, very fitting.  The focus is nice and the blurred background works.  Overall, a good shot.</td>', 'Love the uniqueness of this shot.  The cactus is not something you would usually think of to put glasses on.  The title is great, very fitting.  The focus is nice and the blurred background works.  Overall, a good shot.', '2012-03-23 15:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6721358, 1005474, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Looking through someone else''s glasses.  I like how you tied the title in with the photograph... giving the viewer an idea of what you, as the photographer, envision when shooting.  The blurred surrounds mixed with the "almost" in focus areas of the lenses works great.  Even the tilted horizon adds interest.  Nice neutral colors and well done.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Looking through someone else''s glasses.  I like how you tied the title in with the photograph... giving the viewer an idea of what you, as the photographer, envision when shooting.  The blurred surrounds mixed with the "almost" in focus areas of the lenses works great.  Even the tilted horizon adds interest.  Nice neutral colors and well done.', '2012-03-23 15:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6721361, 1005106, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the close up of this shot.  Nice clean background.  Great DOF on this shot. Very neutral colored shot.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Love the close up of this shot.  Nice clean background.  Great DOF on this shot. Very neutral colored shot.  Nicely composed.', '2012-03-23 15:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6721364, 1005307, 134859, '<td valign="top">I love these types of glasses, haven''t been able to find any though.  <br/> <br/>I like how this is the only thing in the frame.  The focus seems to be a touch off, a little more sharpness would have been better, IMO (as I am noticing the top of the right lens frame seems to be OOF).  <br/> <br/>But I do like the reflection of the glasses, the lighting seems to be good.  <br/> <br/>It''s simplistic, yet interesting at the same time.</td>', 'I love these types of glasses, haven''t been able to find any though.   I like how this is the only thing in the frame.  The focus seems to be a touch off, a little more sharpness would have been better, IMO (as I am noticing the top of the right lens frame seems to be OOF).   But I do like the reflection of the glasses, the lighting seems to be good.   It''s simplistic, yet interesting at the same time.', '2012-03-23 15:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6721365, 1005477, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white.  Love the detail.  And a viewer can make up a story behind the shot.  The dark shadows add even more interest, as the lighting barely shining gives just enough to pop the photo.  <br/>Very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful black and white.  Love the detail.  And a viewer can make up a story behind the shot.  The dark shadows add even more interest, as the lighting barely shining gives just enough to pop the photo.  Very well done.', '2012-03-23 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6721366, 1005471, 134859, '<td valign="top">First thing I noticed... Edgar Allen Poe... one of my all-time favorite writers.  I love the darkness and the color to this shot... it adds a "dark mysteriousness" to it.  The noise/grain works in favor here.  The coffee cup adds that little extra to the shot.  The way it''s composed is beautiful.  Very nicely done</td>', 'First thing I noticed... Edgar Allen Poe... one of my all-time favorite writers.  I love the darkness and the color to this shot... it adds a "dark mysteriousness" to it.  The noise/grain works in favor here.  The coffee cup adds that little extra to the shot.  The way it''s composed is beautiful.  Very nicely done', '2012-03-23 15:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
