(6723307, 1005352, 134859, '<td valign="top">The shot isn''t doing it for me.  Not sure if it is the tight crop, the angle of the head, the lighting... but something is throwing it off to me.  I think that if you would have softened the skin a little, added a warm glow to the skin, it may have made an interesting difference.</td>', 'The shot isn''t doing it for me.  Not sure if it is the tight crop, the angle of the head, the lighting... but something is throwing it off to me.  I think that if you would have softened the skin a little, added a warm glow to the skin, it may have made an interesting difference.', '2012-03-26 15:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723309, 1004964, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot.  I like the "real life" of this.  Initially, I focused on the people in the background, rather than the foreground.<br/>Nice color conversion as well.</td>', 'Nice candid shot.  I like the "real life" of this.  Initially, I focused on the people in the background, rather than the foreground.Nice color conversion as well.', '2012-03-26 15:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723310, 1004955, 134859, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Love bulldogs.  What a cutie.  Great DOF and colors!  Love the underbite... too cute</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Love bulldogs.  What a cutie.  Great DOF and colors!  Love the underbite... too cute', '2012-03-26 15:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723311, 1005278, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is different.  I laughed.  :)<br/>Good color.  like the look on her face.</td>', 'This is different.  I laughed.  :)Good color.  like the look on her face.', '2012-03-26 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723312, 1005506, 134859, '<td valign="top">I get the sunglasses link... but I''m not feeling the complete blur of the shot.  <br/>JMO<br/>Maybe bringing the tiger in focus and the rest in blur... or even just the glasses in focus?</td>', 'I get the sunglasses link... but I''m not feeling the complete blur of the shot.  JMOMaybe bringing the tiger in focus and the rest in blur... or even just the glasses in focus?', '2012-03-26 15:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723314, 1004829, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice real-life shot.  Can barely see the glasses... but I like the pose of him, being oblivious to your camera.  Good title as well... he looks pretty angry, or at least irritated.  <br/>Good job.</td>', 'Nice real-life shot.  Can barely see the glasses... but I like the pose of him, being oblivious to your camera.  Good title as well... he looks pretty angry, or at least irritated.  Good job.', '2012-03-26 15:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723315, 1005493, 134859, '<td valign="top">Different.  I think the blur works here with the noise and color conversion.  Well done</td>', 'Different.  I think the blur works here with the noise and color conversion.  Well done', '2012-03-26 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723317, 1004727, 134859, '<td valign="top">A little dark for me... too much greys.  <br/>Perhaps a sharper, more in focus shot, would have better portrayed your image?  <br/>But I like the angle, and the uniqueness.</td>', 'A little dark for me... too much greys.  Perhaps a sharper, more in focus shot, would have better portrayed your image?  But I like the angle, and the uniqueness.', '2012-03-26 15:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723318, 1004853, 134859, '<td valign="top">The model seems to be completely OOF, as do the shads.  The direct sunlight on his face also seems a little harsh.  Perhaps a slight bit turned towards the photographer... and a sharper, crisper, image, and it would have been better?  JMO</td>', 'The model seems to be completely OOF, as do the shads.  The direct sunlight on his face also seems a little harsh.  Perhaps a slight bit turned towards the photographer... and a sharper, crisper, image, and it would have been better?  JMO', '2012-03-26 15:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723321, 1005431, 134859, '<td valign="top">Looks a little OOF.  But maybe that''s what you were going for?<br/>I think with a little sharper, this would have looked much better.</td>', 'Looks a little OOF.  But maybe that''s what you were going for?I think with a little sharper, this would have looked much better.', '2012-03-26 15:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723322, 1005396, 134859, '<td valign="top">LOVE the title.  The white balance looks a little off... and the lighting is strange, coming from different directions, it seems.  The shadows are a little distracting.  And there seems to be a lot going on.  Perhaps a different arrangement, or less glasses?  Just a thought.</td>', 'LOVE the title.  The white balance looks a little off... and the lighting is strange, coming from different directions, it seems.  The shadows are a little distracting.  And there seems to be a lot going on.  Perhaps a different arrangement, or less glasses?  Just a thought.', '2012-03-26 15:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723323, 1004943, 134859, '<td valign="top">Still trying to make out the reflection in the lens.  The focal point seems to be at the bottom right of the frame?  Not sure if that was done on purpose or not.  A unique photo.  But I don''t care too much for the focus.  JMO</td>', 'Still trying to make out the reflection in the lens.  The focal point seems to be at the bottom right of the frame?  Not sure if that was done on purpose or not.  A unique photo.  But I don''t care too much for the focus.  JMO', '2012-03-26 15:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723324, 1005436, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  Colors seem a little plain/bland, to me.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  Colors seem a little plain/bland, to me.', '2012-03-26 15:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723325, 1005126, 134859, '<td valign="top">Good close up, but a little OOF for my liking.  I think a shot like this would have looked better completely in focus and sharper.</td>', 'Good close up, but a little OOF for my liking.  I think a shot like this would have looked better completely in focus and sharper.', '2012-03-26 15:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723326, 1005425, 134859, '<td valign="top">The light is a little bright, which throws the shot off for me.  Nice detail with the water drops on the cap, however.</td>', 'The light is a little bright, which throws the shot off for me.  Nice detail with the water drops on the cap, however.', '2012-03-26 15:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723327, 1004551, 134859, '<td valign="top">The white balance looks a little off and the colors seem a little flat.  Also, it seems to be OOF.  But I do like the idea.  :)</td>', 'The white balance looks a little off and the colors seem a little flat.  Also, it seems to be OOF.  But I do like the idea.  :)', '2012-03-26 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723329, 1005187, 134859, '<td valign="top">The sunglasses don''t seem to be the main subject in this photo, which puts me on the fence.  First, I like all the red.  And I like that the glasses aren''t the main point, but then again, I don''t.  I think this is the only shot I would vote both a 3 and a 9 for.  So I will settle with a 7, since it''s made me think for so long.  Very interesting idea.</td>', 'The sunglasses don''t seem to be the main subject in this photo, which puts me on the fence.  First, I like all the red.  And I like that the glasses aren''t the main point, but then again, I don''t.  I think this is the only shot I would vote both a 3 and a 9 for.  So I will settle with a 7, since it''s made me think for so long.  Very interesting idea.', '2012-03-26 15:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6723394, 1005331, 50695, '<td valign="top">oh yeah, you get a 7 for putting glasses on a hummingbird.</td>', 'oh yeah, you get a 7 for putting glasses on a hummingbird.', '2012-03-26 16:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
