(6723960, 1005307, 66384, '<td valign="top">These tones are beautiful and perfectly enhance the antique glasses. I would like to know how you accomplished the gold reflection of the lenses.</td>', 'These tones are beautiful and perfectly enhance the antique glasses. I would like to know how you accomplished the gold reflection of the lenses.', '2012-03-27 11:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
