(6724038, 1005352, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. I like the shallow depth of field and the darker background. Red was a nice choice. I do find the glare on the upper lip somewhat distracting. Perhaps you could have done some cloning or something to remove that. You did a very nice job controlling the light on the glasses.</td>', 'Great portrait. I like the shallow depth of field and the darker background. Red was a nice choice. I do find the glare on the upper lip somewhat distracting. Perhaps you could have done some cloning or something to remove that. You did a very nice job controlling the light on the glasses.', '2012-03-27 13:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6724080, 1005453, 100831, '<td valign="top">round, very round. I like it.</td>', 'round, very round. I like it.', '2012-03-27 13:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
