(6724721, 1005482, 127021, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> great effect. I''m guessing the outfit is actually "adjusted" and the glasses aligned to it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>the setup was<br/>1. fix the glasses in place as noted<br/>2. carefully cut the shirt around where we remembered the frames were on her body<br/>3. reposition her for about 15 minutes until she complains that she''s tired<br/>4. shoot quickly</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: great effect. I''m guessing the outfit is actually "adjusted" and the glasses aligned to it.   the setup was1. fix the glasses in place as noted2. carefully cut the shirt around where we remembered the frames were on her body3. reposition her for about 15 minutes until she complains that she''s tired4. shoot quickly', '2012-03-28 02:36:03.000000', NULL, 0),
