(6725045, 1005482, 117474, '<td valign="top">You get yourself this<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1000203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1000203.gif"/></a> <br/>''cause you had the most randomness in the votes you received. <br/> <br/>But in a personal note I thought this was very well done and very creative. I might have touched the exposure and gotten more of an interaction with the subject and the camera, but that would take away from the voyeuristic feel you were going for of course. Don''t worry about the 1''s and 2''s. The bling you get in this challenge says that the votes you got were the most random in this challenge. That means you get a lot of low votes and a lot of high votes. <br/>Great image. Delighted to see this do well!</td>', 'You get yourself this ''cause you had the most randomness in the votes you received.  But in a personal note I thought this was very well done and very creative. I might have touched the exposure and gotten more of an interaction with the subject and the camera, but that would take away from the voyeuristic feel you were going for of course. Don''t worry about the 1''s and 2''s. The bling you get in this challenge says that the votes you got were the most random in this challenge. That means you get a lot of low votes and a lot of high votes. Great image. Delighted to see this do well!', '2012-03-28 10:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
