(6725241, 1005482, 127021, '<td valign="top">Thank you all very much for the comments - at the end the brightness might have cost me the ribbon.  And the only reasoning for the 1''s and 2''s that I can imagine is that some people might have disliked the sexy look? Anyway, without them I wouldn''t have gotten my first DPC BLING thanks to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=117474" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">NiallOTuama</a>!!! <br/> <br/>I''m thinking of a reshoot in a different environment (this was shot in my bedroom with half the tripod on the bed and 3 pillows helping hold the glasses device)<br/> <br/>Once again thanks so much for the comments, they''re helping me along this bumpy road of photography!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-03-28 11:21:55.</i></td>', 'Thank you all very much for the comments - at the end the brightness might have cost me the ribbon.  And the only reasoning for the 1''s and 2''s that I can imagine is that some people might have disliked the sexy look? Anyway, without them I wouldn''t have gotten my first DPC BLING thanks to  NiallOTuama!!!  I''m thinking of a reshoot in a different environment (this was shot in my bedroom with half the tripod on the bed and 3 pillows helping hold the glasses device) Once again thanks so much for the comments, they''re helping me along this bumpy road of photography!', '2012-03-28 13:26:47.000000', '2014-03-28 11:21:55.000000', 0),
